    "resourcesUrl": "https://www.st.com/resource/en/reference_manual/cd00171190-stm32f101xx-stm32f102xx-stm32f103xx-stm32f105xx-and-stm32f107xx-advanced-armbased-32bit-mcus-stmicroelectronics.pdf",
    "kind": "document",
    "mechanicalProblem": {
      "type": "single_choice",
      "options": [
        "EXTI->PR = (1u << 5);",
        "EXTI->PR |= (1u << 5);",
        "EXTI->PR = 0;",
        "EXTI->PR &= ~(1u << 5);"
      ],
      "answers": [
        "0"
      ],
      "explanation": "PR相应位写1才清除，写0保持。直接写第5位掩码只清5；读改写会把原先为1的第7位也写回1，从而误清。此类寄存器不能按普通内存变量的位操作直觉处理。",
